@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Class structure — Scope queries to a congregation
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide empty members

interface ICongregationContext {
  +bool IsResolved
  +Guid CongregationId
  +Guid MemberId
}
class CongregationContext {
  +bool IsResolved
  +Guid CongregationId
  +Guid MemberId
}
interface ITenantOwned {
  +Guid CongregationId
}
class BarnabasDbContext {
  +DbSet<Listing> Listings
  +DbSet<ListingRequest> Requests
  +DbSet<MessageThread> Threads
  #OnModelCreating(ModelBuilder) : void
  -ApplyCongregationFilter(ModelBuilder) : void
}
interface IAuthenticationStore {
  +FindMemberByEmailAddress(string) : Member
  +FindSignInTokenByHash(string) : SignInToken
  +FindSessionById(Guid) : Session
}
class CongregationContextMissingException {
  +string EntityName
}
class Listing {
  +Guid Id
  +Guid CongregationId
}
class ListingRequest {
  +Guid Id
  +Guid CongregationId
}
class MessageThread {
  +Guid Id
  +Guid CongregationId
}

ICongregationContext <|.. CongregationContext
ITenantOwned <|.. Listing
ITenantOwned <|.. ListingRequest
ITenantOwned <|.. MessageThread
BarnabasDbContext --> ICongregationContext : reads current congregation from
BarnabasDbContext ..> ITenantOwned : filters every set of
BarnabasDbContext ..> CongregationContextMissingException : raises when unresolved
IAuthenticationStore ..> BarnabasDbContext : the one sanctioned bypass
@enduml
